#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:2
msgid "Connect GitHub to Mattermost"
msgstr "GitHub를 OKR.BEST에 연결"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:7
msgid ""
"Minimize distractions and reduce context switching between your GitHub "
"code repositories and your communication platform by integrating GitHub "
"with Mattermost. Help your teams stay focused and productive with real-"
"time updates on commits, pull requests, issues, and more directly from "
"Mattermost channels."
msgstr "GitHub를 OKR.BEST와 통합하여 GitHub 코드 리포지토리와 커뮤니케이션 플랫폼 간의 방해 요소를 최소화하고 컨텍스트 전환을 줄이세요. OKR.BEST 채널에서 직접 커밋, 풀 리퀘스트, 이슈 등에 대한 실시간 업데이트로 팀이 집중력과 생산성을 유지하도록 도우세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:9
msgid "An example of the GitHub integration for Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST용 GitHub 통합의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:13
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "배포"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:15
msgid ""
"A Mattermost system admin must perform the following steps to deploy the "
"GitHub integration."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 시스템 관리자가 GitHub 통합을 배포하려면 다음 단계를 수행해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:18
msgid "Install the integration"
msgstr "통합 설치"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:20
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, from the Product menu |product-list|, select **App "
"Marketplace**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 제품 메뉴 |product-list|\\ 에서 **앱 마켓플레이스**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:100
msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr "제품 메뉴 아이콘을 사용해 채널, 공동 플레이북, 보드 사이를 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:21
msgid "Search for or scroll to GitHub, and select **Install**."
msgstr "GitHub를 검색하거나 스크롤하여 찾은 뒤 **설치**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:24
msgid "Set up the integration"
msgstr "통합 설정"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:26
msgid ""
"You can configure the GitHub integration using either the built-in setup "
"wizard (recommended) or by following the manual configuration steps."
msgstr "기본 제공 설정 마법사(권장)를 사용하거나 수동 구성 단계를 따라 GitHub 통합을 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:30
msgid ""
"The recommended way to configure the GitHub integration is using the "
"built-in setup wizard. The wizard guides you through each step of the "
"configuration process, including creating the OAuth app and webhook in "
"GitHub."
msgstr "GitHub 통합을 구성하는 권장 방법은 기본 제공 설정 마법사를 사용하는 것입니다. 마법사는 GitHub에서 OAuth 앱과 웹훅을 만드는 것을 포함하여 구성 프로세스의 각 단계를 안내합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:32
msgid "In any Mattermost channel, run the ``/github setup`` slash command."
msgstr "아무 OKR.BEST 채널에서 ``/github setup`` 슬래시 명령어를 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:33
msgid "Follow the interactive prompts to complete the setup."
msgstr "대화형 프롬프트에 따라 설정을 완료합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:35
msgid "The wizard walks you through:"
msgstr "마법사는 다음을 안내합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:37
msgid "Creating and configuring an OAuth app in GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub에서 OAuth 앱 생성 및 구성"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:38
msgid "Setting up the webhook connection between GitHub and Mattermost"
msgstr "GitHub와 OKR.BEST 간의 웹훅 연결 설정"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:39
msgid "Announcing the integration to your team"
msgstr "팀에 통합 공지"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:41
msgid ""
"You can also run individual setup steps at any time using the following "
"subcommands:"
msgstr "다음 하위 명령을 사용하여 언제든지 개별 설정 단계를 실행할 수도 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:43
msgid "``/github setup oauth``: Configure the OAuth2 application in GitHub."
msgstr "``/github setup oauth``: GitHub에서 OAuth2 애플리케이션을 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:44
msgid "``/github setup webhook``: Create a webhook from GitHub to Mattermost."
msgstr "``/github setup webhook``: GitHub에서 OKR.BEST로 웹훅을 만듭니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:45
msgid ""
"``/github setup announce``: Announce the integration availability to "
"designated channels."
msgstr "``/github setup announce``: 지정된 채널에 통합 사용 가능 여부를 공지합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:49
msgid ""
"If you prefer to configure the integration manually instead of using the "
"setup wizard, follow the steps below."
msgstr "설정 마법사를 사용하는 대신 통합을 수동으로 구성하려면 아래 단계를 따르세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:51
msgid "**Register an OAuth app in GitHub**"
msgstr "**GitHub에서 OAuth 앱 등록**"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:53
msgid ""
"Go to https://github.com/settings/applications/new to register an OAuth "
"app with GitHub."
msgstr "https://github.com/settings/applications/new 으로 이동하여 GitHub에 OAuth 앱을 등록합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:54
#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:75
msgid "Set the following values:"
msgstr "다음 값을 설정합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:56
msgid "**Application name**: ``Mattermost GitHub Plugin - <YOUR COMPANY NAME>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Homepage URL**: ``https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"github``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Authorization callback URL**: ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-"
"URL.COM/plugins/github/oauth/complete``, replacing ``https://YOUR-"
"MATTERMOST-URL.COM`` with your Mattermost URL. This value must match the "
"Mattermost server URL you use to log in."
msgstr "**Authorization callback URL**: ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-URL.COM/plugins/github/oauth/complete``, ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-URL.COM``\\ 을 OKR.BEST URL로 바꿉니다. 이 값은 로그인에 사용하는 OKR.BEST 서버 URL과 일치해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:60
msgid "Save your changes."
msgstr "변경 사항을 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:61
msgid ""
"Select **Generate a new client secret**, and enter your GitHub password "
"to continue."
msgstr "**Generate a new client secret**\\ 를 선택하고 계속하려면 GitHub 비밀번호를 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:62
msgid "Copy the **Client ID** and **Client Secret** in the resulting screen."
msgstr "표시된 화면에서 **Client ID**\\ 와 **Client Secret**\\ 을 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:63
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, go to **System Console > Plugins > GitHub**, and "
"regenerate both a **Webhook Secret** and **At Rest Encryption Key** by "
"selecting **Regenerate** next to each field. You'll need a copy of the "
"**Webhook Secret** value to create a webhook in GitHub."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 **관리자 도구 > 플러그인 > GitHub**\\ 로 이동하여 각 필드 옆의 **Regenerate**\\ 를 선택해 **Webhook Secret**\\ 과 **At Rest Encryption Key**\\ 를 모두 재생성합니다. GitHub에서 웹훅을 만들려면 **Webhook Secret** 값의 사본이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:67
msgid ""
"We recommend making a copy of your webhook secret and encryption key, as "
"it will only be visible to you once."
msgstr "웹훅 시크릿과 암호화 키는 한 번만 표시되므로 사본을 만들어 둘 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:69
msgid "**Create a webhook in GitHub**"
msgstr "**GitHub에서 웹훅 만들기**"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:71
msgid ""
"Create a webhook in GitHub for each GitHub organization you want to set "
"up."
msgstr "설정하려는 각 GitHub 조직에 대해 GitHub에서 웹훅을 만듭니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:73
msgid ""
"In GitHub, go to the **Settings** page where you want to send "
"notifications from, then select **Webhooks** in the sidebar."
msgstr "GitHub에서 알림을 보내려는 **Settings** 페이지로 이동한 다음, 사이드바에서 **Webhooks**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:74
msgid "Select **Add Webhook**."
msgstr "**Add Webhook**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Payload URL**: ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-"
"URL.COM/plugins/github/webhook``. Replace ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-"
"URL.COM`` with your Mattermost URL."
msgstr "**Payload URL**: ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-URL.COM/plugins/github/webhook``. ``https://YOUR-MATTERMOST-URL.COM``\\ 을 OKR.BEST URL로 바꿉니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:78
msgid "**Content Type**: ``application/json``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:79
msgid "**Secret**: The **Webhook Secret** value you copied earlier."
msgstr "**Secret**: 앞서 복사한 **Webhook Secret** 값입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/github.rst:81
msgid ""
"Under **Which events would you like to trigger this webhook?**, select "
"**Let me select individual events**."
msgstr "**Which events would you like to trigger this webhook?**\\ 에서 **Let me select individual events**\\ 를 선택합니다."

